      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_import_pointer_refreshed_after_seekpoint_append",
      "fine_trace_step": 5,
      "description": "Root cause. `parse_options()` appends a new operation while still holding `op` as a pointer into `options->ops.operations`, but it does not refresh `op` before the next line dereferences it. If the array is full, this call can realloc and invalidate `op`; the fix explicitly re-finds `op` after the append."
    },
