      "verified_by": "a_link_store_sink_uses_stale_import_entry",
      "fine_trace_step": 7,
      "description": "AddressSanitizer crash site. After the append has reallocated the full operations array, this statement stores `&(op2->argument.add_seekpoint)` through dangling pointer `op`, producing the reported heap-use-after-free WRITE of size 4."
    },
